        "text_002t": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Born in Dubai and shaped by the timeless elegance of Emirati heritage, CAS Abaya stands as a refined expression of modern modest couture. Rooted in craftsmanship and elevated by contemporary design, CAS redefines the Emirati abaya style by honouring tradition while shaping the future of luxury modest fashion.<br><br>CAS Abaya is created for women who move effortlessly between heritage and modernity — women who value refined tailoring, exceptional fabric quality, and sophisticated silhouettes. Each piece is thoughtfully designed to celebrate the grace of modest dressing while reflecting the evolving aesthetic of the latest abaya design and new abaya design movements emerging from Dubai’s dynamic fashion landscape.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
