      "blocks": {
        "column_002u": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Craftsmanship & Design Philosophy",
            "text": "<p>At CAS, an abaya is not simply a garment — it is a statement of identity, elegance, and cultural pride. The brand presents an elevated abaya collection Dubai is recognised for, featuring meticulously curated black abayas, intricate lace abayas, fluid pleated silhouettes, and contemporary coloured abayas enriched with detailed handwork and artisanal finishes.<br><br>Every CAS design is developed with a couture mindset. From fabric selection to final finishing, each abaya reflects a commitment to exceptional drape, precision tailoring, and luxurious detailing. The brand’s design philosophy blends classic Emirati modesty with modern structure, creating pieces suitable for daily refinement, formal occasions, and meaningful seasonal celebrations including Ramadan and Eid.</p>"
          }
        },
        "column_002v": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Customer-First Luxury Experience",
            "text": "<p>CAS Abaya is built upon a deeply rooted customer-first philosophy. Every interaction is designed to reflect personalised luxury, from intuitive online browsing to seamless global delivery. The brand believes that exceptional fashion must be accompanied by exceptional service, ensuring each client experiences effortless shopping, transparent communication, and meticulous order care.<br><br>With worldwide shipping, CAS extends the elegance of Dubai abayas beyond borders, connecting women globally with authentic Emirati craftsmanship and refined modest fashion.</p>"
          }
        },
        "column_002w": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Sustainability Through Purposeful Creation",
            "text": "<p>CAS operates through a conscious pre-order model, embodying a modern approach to sustainability within luxury fashion. Each abaya is created with intention, produced from scratch to precise measurements, minimising waste while preserving artisanal quality. This approach allows CAS to prioritise superior materials, responsible production, and enduring garment longevity.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
